<title>USA: PREMIS gets Nasdaq SmallCap listing nod.</title>
<headline>PREMIS gets Nasdaq SmallCap listing nod.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>PREMIS Corp said Wednesday its stock was approved for listing on the Nasdaq SmallCap Market, effective immediately.</p>
<p>The stock trading symbol will continue as &quot;PMIS,&quot; which the company used while listed on the Nasdaq Bulletin Board.</p>
<p>-- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
